*> PLB-C039 decimal-to-alphanumeric: a number with decimal places moved
*> to an alphanumeric item. BALANCE is PLB-M016, which is off by default.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NUMTEXT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  AMOUNT              PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE -12.34.
01  RATE                PIC 9V999 VALUE 1.25.
01  BALANCE             PIC S9(7) VALUE -500.
01  COUNTER             PIC 9(4) VALUE 7.
01  AMOUNT-EDITED       PIC -(5)9.99.
01  TEXT-OUT            PIC X(10).
01  RECORD-OUT.
    05  RECORD-AMOUNT   PIC X(7).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE AMOUNT TO TEXT-OUT
    MOVE RATE TO TEXT-OUT
    MOVE BALANCE TO TEXT-OUT
    MOVE COUNTER TO TEXT-OUT
    MOVE AMOUNT TO AMOUNT-EDITED
    MOVE AMOUNT-EDITED TO TEXT-OUT
    MOVE AMOUNT TO RECORD-AMOUNT
    MOVE AMOUNT TO RECORD-OUT
    DISPLAY TEXT-OUT RECORD-OUT
    STOP RUN.
